  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 (2026-06-18)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - XML file definitions of the EMC NEMS submissions based on version 4.9 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.4.2 (2025-05-26)\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - Adhered report namespaces to namespace naming conventions.\n\n\t\t  1.4.1 (2025-05-22)\n\t\t  Updated\n\t\t  - Changed XSD namespaces from v4.6 to to v4.9 corresponding to version 4.9 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.4.0 (2024-12-07)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - .NET 9.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  1.3.0 (2024-07-10)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - New fields related to the TPC (Temporary Price Cap) Phase 2 enhancements to classes:\n\t\t  Emc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.MCR.Mcr010Report\n\t\t  Emc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.CWR.RealTimePrice\n\t\t  Emc.SewPlus.Nems.Models.Reports.CWR.UsepDemandData.\n\n\t\t  1.2.0 (2024-07-10)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - New properties to existing classes corresponding to the changes listed in version 4.6 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  ### Updated\n\t\t  - Namespaces from v4.3 to v4.6 corresponding to version 4.6 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".\n\n\t\t  1.1.0 (2024-01-05)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - Added .NET 8.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  Removed\n\t\t  - .NET Core 2.x frameworks from the list of class library frameworks.\n\n\t\t  1.0.0 (2022-10-16)\n\t\t  Added\n\t\t  - .NET 7.0 framework to the list of class library frameworks.\n\t\t  - XML file definitions of the EMC NEMS reports download based on version 4.3 of the \"Data Services Specification for NEMS System\".",
